# LANIE Android Runtime — ignore vendored trees, archives and build output.
#
# Rationale: whisper.cpp-master/ and agent-native-main/ are third-party source
# trees (and their .zip duplicates) that are not authored here. They are
# referenced by CMakeLists.txt via an explicit guarded path, and are restored by
# the bootstrap step in README.md. They must never be staged: together they are
# ~430MB / 23k files of third-party code.

# --- vendored third-party (restored by bootstrap) ---
whisper.cpp-master/
whisper.cpp-master.zip
agent-native-main/
agent-native-main.zip

# --- secrets (NEVER commit; DALE is a public repo) ---
# release.properties contains storePassword/keyPassword in clear text and
# release.keystore is the Android signing key.
release.keystore
release.properties
*.keystore
*.jks
*.pem
*.key
.env
!.env.example

# --- build output (regenerated by CMake/Gradle) ---
build/
cmake-build*/
out/
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.so.*
*.class

# --- IDE / tooling state ---
.cg/
.pytest_cache/
.idea/
*.iml

# --- python build/venv artifacts ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
